{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/santorini-samana-developers-dubai-studio-city","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"message":"Property details fetch successfully","data":{"id":1107,"crm_id":"321","search_type":"sales","department":"new_developments","status":"ready","title":"Samana Santorini","slug":"santorini-samana-developers-dubai-studio-city","display_address":"Dubai Studio City","building_type":["apartment","studio"],"completion_year":"2025","developer":"Samana Developers","price":null,"display_price":"TBA","lattitude":25.029533632182,"longitude":55.239593272273,"min_bedrooms":1,"max_bedrooms":3,"display_bedrooms":null,"about":"<p>Samana Santorini is a premium class complex in Dubai City Studio, developed by Samana. The project is a 5-storey apartment building located in a prestigious multifunctional community that has become famous for its commercial focus in the entertainment industry. The complex is designed in the Greek style: snow-white buildings are combined with azure pools and an abundance of greenery, and roofs with gazebos encourage a leisurely and peaceful lifestyle.</p><p>The complex consists of 157 exclusive residences, including <strong>studios and apartments with 1-3 bedrooms</strong>. All residences are decorated with premium materials of high quality, there are panoramic windows and spacious balconies with spectacular views. The 2-bedroom apartment has a private pool.</p><p>The apartments in the complex will provide residents with many first-class amenities, including: a health club, exotic water features, an outdoor cinema, a yoga room, a communal pool and pools on terraces, a Jacuzzi, a barbecue area, parking.</p><p>In addition, a wide range of retail outlets, catering establishments and many other commercial facilities can be found here.</p><p>The complex is perfect for families with children. In fact, this is a spacious playground for playing in a children's pool, and a 5-10-minute drive from the hotel are the Blossom Damak Hills Kindergarten, Victory Heights Elementary School and the Royal Guildford Gymnasium in Dubai.</p>","tile_image":null,"banner_image":null,"media_images":null,"images":[{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/321/images/2023/07/04/qcXo9PfFjRyUO90BOloMdKgwmuVhVrTJdLAjGhDW.jpg","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2023/07/04/qcXo9PfFjRyUO90BOloMdKgwmuVhVrTJdLAjGhDW.jpg","__ggfxIndex":0},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/321/images/2024/07/29/8uRlmBqVE48nwtkesA75Av4u6bY1AY1AMclOJu2w.jpg","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/07/29/8uRlmBqVE48nwtkesA75Av4u6bY1AY1AMclOJu2w.jpg","__ggfxIndex":1},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/321/images/2024/07/29/HNDjHSFw9iOdTmzYkMXm9W8L2zWOLD0NxzCgBCjL.jpg","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/07/29/HNDjHSFw9iOdTmzYkMXm9W8L2zWOLD0NxzCgBCjL.jpg","__ggfxIndex":2},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/321/images/2024/07/29/hXkWaSuCUPcA3Mku0wGqoEKDsZtHyfVDUSRZsXfj.jpg","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/07/29/hXkWaSuCUPcA3Mku0wGqoEKDsZtHyfVDUSRZsXfj.jpg","__ggfxIndex":3},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/321/images/2024/07/29/wJohvwZbWtXv0SkTnbotKPpx2a5G5XG82aUzkGES.jpg","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/07/29/wJohvwZbWtXv0SkTnbotKPpx2a5G5XG82aUzkGES.jpg","__ggfxIndex":4},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/321/images/2024/07/29/Mcab4oIgVZMCLQqRFnJRp2cvI7YtL02xINkKJ8sV.jpg","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/07/29/Mcab4oIgVZMCLQqRFnJRp2cvI7YtL02xINkKJ8sV.jpg","__ggfxIndex":5},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/321/images/2023/07/04/hyhadyJNJ2Btyxrnz7MaAtF8NIsLXqt5uw3DzTSy.jpg","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2023/07/04/hyhadyJNJ2Btyxrnz7MaAtF8NIsLXqt5uw3DzTSy.jpg","__ggfxIndex":6},{"url":"https://ggfx